### ASCII Algorithm

```text
Start
  ↓
Initialize left = 0, ans = 0, freq = {}
  ↓
Expand right
  ↓
freq[s[right]]++
  ↓
freq[s[right]] > 2 ?
  ├── Yes → Remove s[left] → left++
  │          ↓
  │        Check again
  │
  └── No
       ↓
ans = max(ans, right - left + 1)
       ↓
Move right
       ↓
End → return ans
```
